#: src/Addons/NonLoggedInUsers/CartRules/CartRulesSubsection.php:13
msgid ""
"A minimum order amount or quantity for the whole cart per role, and payment "
"or shipping methods limited to roles (the two groups below). Guests count as"
" a role; a customer with several roles gets the strictest minimum. Off by "
"default."
